## 说明 / Note

本项目是一个针对小米/红米电话 App（`com.android.contacts`）的 LSPosed 模块，
仅修改本机已安装应用的运行时行为，**不包含也不分发任何小米/红米的专有代码或资源**。

项目的开发过程中对该 App 的 DEX/资源做了静态分析，以确定可挂钩的方法与视图。
仓库中不包含被分析 APK 的任何内容，也不包含反编译产物。

This project is an LSPosed module that modifies the runtime behaviour of an
already-installed system app on the author's own device. It contains no
proprietary code or resources from Xiaomi. Static analysis of the target APK
was used only to locate hook points; no APK content or decompiled output is
redistributed here.
